WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:18.933
"Girls!" cried Princess Badra. "Magrib is coming!

2
00:00:18.934 --> 00:00:20.552
I must look my best.

3
00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:22.982
Bring me my pearls."

4
00:00:22.983 --> 00:00:29.341
Her attendants ran in circles, and one went downstairs to open the gate.

5
00:00:29.342 --> 00:00:34.480
When the princess heard Magrib's footsteps in the hall, she opened the door.

6
00:00:34.481 --> 00:00:37.942
"Welcome!" she said with a smile.

7
00:00:37.943 --> 00:00:39.741
"Come in, dear man."

8
00:00:39.742 --> 00:00:42.650
The magician didn't know what to say.

9
00:00:42.651 --> 00:00:47.021
Usually she didn't want him around her.

10
00:00:47.022 --> 00:00:51.516
"Princess, I—," he said shyly.

11
00:00:51.517 --> 00:00:56.896
"Oh, you look so handsome," said the princess.

12
00:00:56.897 --> 00:01:01.454
"Sit down! No—not there—sit here!"

13
00:01:01.455 --> 00:01:07.394
The princess took Magrib's hand and led him to the cushion beside her.

14
00:01:07.395 --> 00:01:11.364
"I have been so lonely," she said.

15
00:01:11.365 --> 00:01:14.288
"You must visit more often."

16
00:01:14.289 --> 00:01:20.918
"Princess, I'm so glad to hear you say that," said Magrib happily.

17
00:01:20.919 --> 00:01:25.333
"I've been sad long enough," said the princess.

18
00:01:25.334 --> 00:01:28.485
"Tears will not bring Aladdin back.

19
00:01:28.486 --> 00:01:32.123
So I'm not going to think about him."

20
00:01:32.124 --> 00:01:35.749
She moved a little closer to Magrib.

21
00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:39.140
"I'm going to think about you."

22
00:01:39.141 --> 00:01:43.260
"Oh, Princess," sighed Magrib.

23
00:01:43.261 --> 00:01:46.149
He tried to give her a kiss.

24
00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:48.901
But the princess suddenly jumped up and said,

25
00:01:48.902 --> 00:01:52.309
"We must have wine!"

26
00:01:52.310 --> 00:01:56.221
"You are so kind," said Magrib.

27
00:01:56.222 --> 00:01:59.484
"We should get to know each other—"

28
00:01:59.485 --> 00:02:03.412
"Oh, we will," replied the princess.

29
00:02:03.413 --> 00:02:08.506
"But first, let's make a toast."

30
00:02:08.507 --> 00:02:11.213
She poured wine into two cups.

31
00:02:11.214 --> 00:02:14.371
"To our happiness!"

32
00:02:14.372 --> 00:02:17.848
"To our happiness!" said Magrib.

33
00:02:17.849 --> 00:02:20.717
The princess took a tiny sip.

34
00:02:20.718 --> 00:02:24.880
Magrib drank all his wine in one gulp.

35
00:02:24.881 --> 00:02:28.084
The princess poured more wine.

36
00:02:28.085 --> 00:02:33.174
"Good wine," she said and took another sip.

37
00:02:33.175 --> 00:02:37.733
Magrib emptied his cup, and she poured him more wine.

38
00:02:37.734 --> 00:02:43.325
Magrib drank cup after cup until he felt a bit sleepy.

39
00:02:43.326 --> 00:02:49.131
"Another toast!" shouted the princess. "To Magrib!"

40
00:02:49.132 --> 00:02:54.401
Magrib drank, giggled, and fell over backward.

41
00:02:54.402 --> 00:02:56.472
The cup fell from his hand.

42
00:02:56.473 --> 00:03:03.867
And he started to snore—loudly.

43
00:03:03.868 --> 00:03:08.259
"Aladdin!" called Princess Badra, leaping up. "Come!"

44
00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:14.221
Aladdin rushed in, pulled the lamp from Magrib's coat, and rubbed.

45
00:03:14.222 --> 00:03:19.307
Smoke poured from the lamp and the high melody returned.

46
00:03:19.308 --> 00:03:23.505
"Your wish is my command!" said the genie.

47
00:03:23.506 --> 00:03:26.594
"Ah, it's you, Aladdin!"

48
00:03:26.595 --> 00:03:29.657
Then he saw Magrib on the floor.

49
00:03:29.658 --> 00:03:31.603
"I never liked him."

50
00:03:31.604 --> 00:03:36.833
"Genie," said Aladdin, "fly this palace home!"

51
00:03:36.834 --> 00:03:41.532
"I hear and obey, master!" said the genie.

52
00:03:41.533 --> 00:03:45.911
The genie picked up the palace and started to fly.

53
00:03:45.912 --> 00:03:51.457
Aladdin and Princess Badra hugged each other as they flew home.

54
00:03:51.458 --> 00:03:56.034
The palace landed with a thud, which woke up Magrib.

55
00:03:56.035 --> 00:04:03.902
When he saw Aladdin, he stood up and screamed with rage.

56
00:04:03.903 --> 00:04:09.765
Then he jumped out the palace window and ran away.

57
00:04:09.766 --> 00:04:15.888
Well, you must imagine the sultan sadly looking out his window that morning.

58
00:04:15.889 --> 00:04:20.193
Suddenly Aladdin's palace came down from the sky.

59
00:04:20.194 --> 00:04:23.755
His daughter was waving from the window.

60
00:04:23.756 --> 00:04:30.347
Full of joy, the sultan hurried down the red carpet to greet the happy couple.

61
00:04:30.348 --> 00:04:35.424
He ordered his guards to bring Zeba to the palace for a big party.

62
00:04:35.425 --> 00:04:40.634
Everyone in the kingdom was invited to celebrate his daughter's return.

63
00:04:40.635 --> 00:04:43.619
Everyone but the grand vizier.

64
00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:48.021
He had to stay in his room.

65
00:04:48.022 --> 00:04:52.516
Aladdin and Princess Badra never saw Magrib again.

66
00:04:52.517 --> 00:04:56.526
They lived long lives and had many children.

67
00:04:56.527 --> 00:05:00.221
In time, Aladdin became sultan.

68
00:05:00.222 --> 00:05:05.519
He ruled in peace and the people loved him.

69
00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:09.317
So this story has a happy ending.

70
00:05:09.318 --> 00:05:13.154
That's another reason my king likes it so well.

71
00:05:13.155 --> 00:05:16.115
Would you like to hear another story?

72
00:05:16.116 --> 00:05:19.527
Oh, not today, but some other day.

73
00:05:19.528 --> 00:05:22.273
I know a thousand more!

74
00:05:22.274 --> 00:05:28.477
Would you like to hear the one about . . .?
